%F A402469 G.f.: Sum_{k>=1} Product_{j=1..k} x^k*(1 + x^(3*j))*(1 + x^(3*j-1))*(1 + x^(3*j-2)).
%F A402469 a(n) ~ c * d^sqrt(n) / sqrt(n), where d = 3.43868429749108892564... and c = 0.28208344025380074...
